# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) accepted (a GM) by level 66 chars of the jobs Waughroon Shrine serves: RDM (5), THF (6), BST (9),
# one char each (main the first). Each trades its job's testimony (64 with its job id) and answers 1: tradedTestimony
# 1, set down at Waughroon Shrine (-349.899 104.213 -260.150, zone 144); the char zones at the next tick.
# Then each char, in the flow's order, enters its own Maat fight in its own area (1, 2, 3: the fights of one zone
# run side by side): a GM warp by BC_Entrance (the flow parser follows zones by warp), the testimony traded (the 32000
# menu), 32000 updated with option index * 16 + area (registered, entered; the testimony wears), finished; that
# area's Maat "killed" (unkillable: 1 HP; he yields, battlefield:win, at a later onMobFight, so some kills take ticks
# before the 32001 opens; battlefieldWin the fight's id), and the win's 32001 finished: accepted, so a Scroll of
# Instant Warp, Prog = the job id, the job's maatsCap bit (1 << (job - 1): a fresh char's maatsCap is 0), Maat Masher.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/64 WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrade WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=RDM lvl=66
char thf zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=THF lvl=66
char bst zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=BST lvl=66
levelcap 70
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
item RedMagesTestimony
thf: levelcap 70
thf: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
thf: item ThiefsTestimony
bst: levelcap 70
bst: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
bst: item BeastmastersTestimony
login
trade Maat RedMagesTestimony x1         # RDM's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (5)
finish option=1                         # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Waughroon Shrine
tick 400
login                                   # in Waughroon Shrine
thf: login
thf: trade Maat ThiefsTestimony x1      # THF's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (6)
thf: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Waughroon Shrine
tick 400
thf: login                              # in Waughroon Shrine
bst: login
bst: trade Maat BeastmastersTestimony x1 # BST's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (9)
bst: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Waughroon Shrine
tick 400
bst: login                              # in Waughroon Shrine
warp -338.1,104.3,-260.3 WaughroonShrine  # by BC_Entrance
trade BC_Entrance RedMagesTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=97                  # Shattering Stars (RDM), index 6, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill MAAT                               # Maat (RDM) of area 1: 1 HP (unkillable), won once he yields, battlefieldWin 70
tick 1000                               # Maat is unkillable: he yields (battlefield:win) in a later onMobFight; 32001 opens on the last tick
tick 1000
tick 1000
finish                                  # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 5, maatsCap 16, Maat Masher
thf: warp -338.1,104.3,-260.3 WaughroonShrine  # by BC_Entrance
thf: trade BC_Entrance ThiefsTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
thf: update 32000 option=114            # Shattering Stars (THF), index 7, area 2: registered, entered
thf: finish                             # in the arena
thf: kill MAAT+4                        # Maat (THF) of area 2: won, battlefieldWin 71, 32001 opens
thf: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 6, maatsCap 32, Maat Masher
bst: warp -338.1,104.3,-260.3 WaughroonShrine  # by BC_Entrance
bst: trade BC_Entrance BeastmastersTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
bst: update 32000 option=131            # Shattering Stars (BST), index 8, area 3: registered, entered
bst: finish                             # in the arena
bst: kill MAAT+10                       # Maat (BST) of area 3: won, battlefieldWin 72, 32001 opens
bst: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 9, maatsCap 256, Maat Masher
